			"color":"#232",
			"widgets_values":[
				"Cyber wuxia silhouette style, main colors blue / pink / purple, background pure gray-white gradient; first frame shows wuxia silhouette in standing pose with sword sheathed, hat shadowing face, sword blade slanting forward, blue-purple light effects like ribbons winding around both arms, posture calm and restrained; final frame shows wuxia silhouette in initial sword-swinging stance, center of gravity sinking, sword blade slashing forward-left, blue-pink-purple smoke bursting and swirling, glowing particles scattered at the bottom, posture full of tension; transitional shots: 0-2 seconds slight shoulder and waist tension movement, sword slowly lowering, blue-purple light effects gently flowing between arms, smoke beginning to diffuse outward; 2-4 seconds slow body rotation centered on waist, center of gravity gradually sinking, sword trailing backward-left with rotation to gather force, light effect transitioning from blue-purple to pink-purple, smoke forming vortex-like flow; 4-6 seconds sword rapidly slashing forward-left with motion blur trail, body center of gravity shifting forward with sword movement, smoke bursting and swirling, pink-purple light effect peaking, particle splashes appearing at bottom; 6-8 seconds sword movement reaching endpoint, character posture stabilizing at final frame's sword-swinging stance, slight body tremor followed by complete stillness, smoke form stabilizing into explosive state, particle effects gradually converging, background light effects synchronously dimming and brightening with tremor; maintain high-contrast silhouette effect throughout, smooth flowing light effects without stuttering, smoke layers naturally changing with actions, smooth color transitions, enhancing cyber wuxia atmosphere and dynamic tension."
			],
